      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Woodson%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Spoon Creek borders the northern edge of Woodson, flowing west toward Sandy Creek and eventually the Illinois River.",
